msgstr "Is u seker u wil die vervalde poort-na-MAC-na-IP-resultate nou skrap?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to purge the cached Mactrack scanning functions?"
msgstr "Is jy seker jy wil die gekaste Mactrack-skandeerfunksies suiwer?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Is u seker u wil al die saamgevoegde poort-na-MAC-na-IP-resultate uit die stelsel skrap?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete and recreate all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Is u seker u wil al die saamgevoegde poort-na-MAC-na-IP-resultate uit die stelsel skrap en herskep?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to download and import the IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI database now?"
msgstr "Is u seker u wil die IEEE-verskaffer MAC/OUI-databasis nou aflaai en invoer?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to rebuild the scan date list from the stored Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Is jy seker jy wil die skandeerdatumlys nou vanuit die gestoorde Poort-na-MAC-na-IP-resultate herbou?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Rebuild and analyze the partition containing the latest port observation, which is the current week with weekly partitions. An unpartitioned table is optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped while this runs. Continue?"
msgstr "Herbou en ontleed die partisie wat die jongste poortwaarneming bevat, wat die huidige week is met weeklikse partisies. 'n Ongepartisioneerde tabel word ten volle geoptimaliseer. Geskeduleerde skanderings word oorgeslaan terwyl dit loop. Gaan voort?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Run this maintenance off hours. The rebuild copies the full history of the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables one after the other and can take hours. Scheduled scans are skipped, database maintenance waits, and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message until it finishes. Allow free disk space for a second copy of each table and its indexes. Continue?"
msgstr "Voer hierdie instandhouding buite kantoorure uit. Die herbouing kopieer die volledige geskiedenis van die poort- (MAC-adres), IP-adres- en 802.1x-tabelle een na die ander en kan ure neem. Geskeduleerde skanderings word oorgeslaan, databasisinstandhouding wag, en soektogte vir MAC, IP en 802.1x wys 'n instandhoudingsboodskap totdat dit voltooi is. Maak voorsiening vir vrye skyfspasie vir 'n tweede kopie van elke tabel en sy indekse. Gaan voort?"

