#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "The port, IP and 802.1x tables are being repartitioned, or a rebuild did not finish, so their history cannot be changed now. Try again when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php has finished."
msgstr "Die poort-, IP- en 802.1x-tabelle word herpartisioneer, of 'n herbou is nie voltooi nie, so hul geskiedenis kan nie nou verander word nie. Probeer weer wanneer cli/upgrade_partitioning.php klaar is."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "MacTrack is in maintenance mode for IP address, MAC address and 802.1x searching while its history tables are repartitioned. Results are incomplete until the partitioning has finished."
msgstr "MacTrack is in instandhoudingsmodus vir IP-adres-, MAC-adres- en 802.1x-soektogte terwyl sy geskiedenistabelle herpartisioneer word. Resultate is onvolledig totdat die partisionering voltooi is."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "MacTrack is in maintenance mode for IP address, MAC address and 802.1x searching because the partitioning of its history tables did not finish. Results are incomplete. Run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php again to resume it."
msgstr "MacTrack is in instandhoudingsmodus vir IP-adres-, MAC-adres- en 802.1x-soektogte omdat die partisionering van sy geskiedenistabelle nie voltooi het nie. Resultate is onvolledig. Voer cli/upgrade_partitioning.php weer uit om dit te hervat."

