#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Database Administration"
msgstr "Databasisadministrasie"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes expired Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Only records that have expired, based upon your criteria are removed."
msgstr "Skrap vervalde poort-na-MAC-na-IP-assosiasies uit die databasis. Slegs rekords wat op grond van jou kriteria verval het, word verwyder."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Refresh IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI Database"
msgstr "Verfris IEEE-verskaffer-MAC/OUI-databasis"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "This function will download and install the latest OIU database from the IEEE Website.  Each Network Interface Card (NIC) has a MAC Address.  The MAC Address can be broken into two parts.  The first part of the MAC Address contains the Vendor MAC.  The Vendor MAC identifies who manufactured the part.  This will be helpful in spot checking for rogue devices on your network."
msgstr "Hierdie funksie sal die nuutste OIU-databasis vanaf die IEEE-webwerf aflaai en installeer. Elke Netwerkkoppelvlakkaart (NIC) het 'n MAC-adres. Die MAC-adres kan in twee dele verdeel word. Die eerste deel van die MAC-adres bevat die Verskaffer-MAC. Die Verskaffer-MAC identifiseer wie die onderdeel vervaardig het. Dit sal nuttig wees om steekproefgewys vir ongeoorloofde toestelle op u netwerk te kyk."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes old and potentially stale Mactrack scanning functions from the drop-down you receive when you edit a device type."
msgstr "Skrap ou en moontlik verouderde Mactrack-skandeerfunksies uit die aftreklys wat jy kry wanneer jy 'n toesteltipe wysig."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes <strong>ALL</strong> Port to MAC to IP associations from the database all IP Addresses, IP Ranges, and VLANS.  This utility is good when you want to start over.  <strong>DANGER: All prior data is deleted.</strong>"
msgstr "Skrap <strong>ALLE</strong> poort-na-MAC-na-IP-assosiasies uit die databasis, alle IP-adresse, IP-reekse en VLAN's. Hierdie nutsprogram is handig wanneer jy van voor af wil begin. <strong>GEVAAR: Alle vorige data word geskrap.</strong>"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds the list of scan dates from the stored Port to MAC to IP results, reading each partition once. Scans and maintenance keep the list current, so this is only needed after results were removed outside of maintenance, for example by deleting devices."
msgstr "Herbou die lys skanderingsdatums uit die gestoorde Poort-na-MAC-na-IP-resultate deur elke partisie een keer te lees. Skanderings en instandhouding hou die lys op datum, dus is dit slegs nodig nadat resultate buite instandhouding verwyder is, byvoorbeeld deur toestelle te skrap."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "View Partition Status"
msgstr "Bekyk partisiestatus"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Shows how the Port to MAC to IP results are partitioned, the partition size in use and why, and what the last database maintenance did."
msgstr "Toon hoe die Poort-na-MAC-na-IP-resultate gepartisioneer is, die partisiegrootte wat gebruik word en hoekom, en wat die laaste databasisinstandhouding gedoen het."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds and analyzes only the partition containing the latest port observation to reclaim deleted space; with weekly partitions that is the current week. Unpartitioned tables are optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped until it finishes."
msgstr "Herbou en ontleed slegs die partisie wat die jongste poortwaarneming bevat om geskrapte spasie te herwin; met weeklikse partisies is dit die huidige week. Ongepartisioneerde tabelle word ten volle geoptimaliseer. Geskeduleerde skanderings word oorgeslaan totdat dit voltooi is."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Choose daily or weekly partitions, or disable partitioning, for the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables. The rebuild copies the full history in the background; scheduled scans are skipped and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message meanwhile."
msgstr "Kies daaglikse of weeklikse partisies, of deaktiveer partisionering, vir die poort- (MAC-adres), IP-adres- en 802.1x-tabelle. Die herbou kopieer die volledige geskiedenis in die agtergrond; geskeduleerde skanderings word oorgeslaan en MAC-, IP- en 802.1x-soektogte wys intussen 'n instandhoudingsboodskap."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Aggregated Table Administration"
msgstr "Geaggregeerde tabeladministrasie"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Data will again be collected on the basis of <strong>only new</strong> scanned data in the next mactrack poller run."
msgstr "Skrap ALLE <strong>saamgevoegde</strong> (nie skanderingsresultate nie) poort-na-MAC-na-IP-assosiasies uit die databasis. Data sal weer ingesamel word op grond van <strong>slegs nuwe</strong> geskandeerde data tydens die volgende mactrack-poller-lopie."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP associations from the database and their re-creation based on <strong>All scanned data</strong> now."
msgstr "Skrap ALLE <strong>saamgevoegde</strong> (nie skanderingsresultate nie) poort-na-MAC-na-IP-assosiasies uit die databasis en herskep hulle nou op grond van <strong>alle geskandeerde data</strong>."

