msgstr "Kies wanneer MAC- en IP-adresse en koppelvlakstatistieke van jou netwerktoestelle ingesamel moet word."

#: setup.php
msgid "Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Gelyktydige prosesse"

#: setup.php
msgid "Specify how many devices will be polled simultaneously until all devices have been polled."
msgstr "Spesifiseer hoeveel toestelle gelyktydig gepol sal word totdat alle toestelle gepol is."

#: setup.php
msgid "Scanner Max Runtime"
msgstr "Maksimum looptyd van skandeerder"

#: setup.php
msgid "Specify the number of minutes a device scanning function will be allowed to run prior to the system assuming it has been completed.  This setting will correct for abended scanning jobs."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die aantal minute wat 'n toestelskanderingfunksie toegelaat word om te loop voordat die stelsel aanneem dit is voltooi. Hierdie instelling sal regstel vir skanderingstake wat voortydig gestaak het."

#: setup.php
msgid "Start Time for Data Collection"
msgstr "Begintyd vir data-insameling"

#: setup.php
msgid "When would you like the first data collection to take place.  All future data collection times will be based upon this start time.  A good example would be 12:00AM."
msgstr "Wanneer wil jy hê moet die eerste data-insameling plaasvind.  Alle toekomstige data-insamelingstye sal op hierdie begintyd gebaseer word.  'n Goeie voorbeeld is 12:00 VM."

#: setup.php
msgid "Database Maintenance Time"
msgstr "Databasis-instandhoudingstyd"

#: setup.php
msgid "When should old database records be removed from the database.  Please note that no access will be permitted to the port database while this action is taking place."
msgstr "Wanneer moet ou databasisrekords uit die databasis verwyder word.  Neem asseblief kennis dat geen toegang tot die poortdatabasis toegelaat sal word terwyl hierdie aksie plaasvind nie."

