msgstr "Databewaring-IP's"

#: setup.php
msgid "How long should discovered IPs details be retained in the database."
msgstr "Hoe lank moet besonderhede van ontdekte IP's in die databasis behou word."

#: setup.php
msgid "Size of the partitions of the port, IP and 802.1x tables, or Disabled for unpartitioned tables. Changing it affects new partitions only; to rebuild the existing history to match, use Configure Port and IP Address Partitioning in MacTrack Utilities or run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."
msgstr "Grootte van die partisies van die poort-, IP- en 802.1x-tabelle, of Gedeaktiveer vir ongepartisioneerde tabelle. Wysiging hiervan raak slegs nuwe partisies; om die bestaande geskiedenis te herbou sodat dit ooreenstem, gebruik Configure Port and IP Address Partitioning in MacTrack Utilities of voer cli/upgrade_partitioning.php uit."

