msgstr "Poorte om te ignoreer"

#: setup.php
msgid "Provide a regular expression of ifNames or ifDescriptions of ports to ignore in the interface list.  For example, (Vlan|Loopback|Null)."
msgstr "Verskaf 'n gereelde uitdrukking van ifNames of ifDescriptions van poorte om in die koppelvlaklys te ignoreer. Byvoorbeeld, (Vlan|Loopback|Null)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Ports to Ignore While Scanning (Regular Expression)"
msgstr "Poorte om te ignoreer tydens skandering (Reguliere uitdrukking)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional.  A regular expression matched, without regard to case, against the port name and the port alias of every scanned port.  MAC addresses found on a matching port are not collected, which keeps uplink and trunk ports out of the database.  For example, (uplink|trunk).  Put each expression on its own line to give several.  Leave empty to collect every port.  Sites and devices can add their own expressions.  Unlike Ports to Ignore above, this applies to MAC collection and not to the interface list, and it affects new scans only."
msgstr "Opsioneel.  'n Gereelde uitdrukking wat, sonder inagneming van hoof-/kleinletters, gepas word teen die poortnaam en die poortalias van elke geskandeerde poort.  MAC-adresse wat op 'n passende poort gevind word, word nie ingesamel nie, wat uplink- en trunk-poorte uit die databasis hou.  Byvoorbeeld, (uplink|trunk).  Plaas elke uitdrukking op sy eie reël om verskeie op te gee.  Laat leeg om elke poort in te samel.  Terreine en toestelle kan hul eie uitdrukkings byvoeg.  Anders as 'Poorte om te ignoreer' hierbo, geld dit vir MAC-insameling en nie vir die koppelvlaklys nie, en dit raak slegs nuwe skanderings."

